flowchart TB
  accTitle: One DorkOS program in three roles today, with planned parts dashed, and the seams between them
  accDescr: The accepted direction of ADR 261015-042933 as of 2026-11-21. One server package runs as a person's computer, a hub or an agent computer, and ships the space server as a fourth entry. Solid boxes exist in the source at this review, including the ones that are off by default; dashed boxes are planned. Servers connect by pairing. A computer's chats reach the web through the chat relay. The hub role, the agent-computer role and the relay are built but gated or off by default; the hub image has booted only in CI. Nothing here is deployment proof.

  subgraph computer["Your computer · shipped"]
    mac["<b>DorkOS server and app</b><br/><span class='d'>Runs your agents · rooms, tasks, beats, audit</span>"]
    relayMac["<b>Chat relay</b><br/><span class='d'>Dials your hub · chats only · off until linked</span>"]
    localvm["<b>Sealed computer on the Mac</b><br/><span class='d'>Experiment · off by default</span>"]
    mac --> relayMac
    mac -->|"turns, tool bridge<br/><span class='d'>off by default</span>"| localvm
  end

  subgraph hub["Hub · built, not deployed"]
    hubsrv["<b>Hub mode</b><br/><span class='d'>Runs no agents · one owner, named by Cloud</span>"]
    priv["<b>Private space</b><br/><span class='d'>The hub's local space, locked to its owner</span>"]
    relayHub["<b>Relay endpoint</b><br/><span class='d'>Takes the computer's dial · wakes it when viewed</span>"]
    fwd["<b>Work forwarded to an agent computer</b><br/><span class='d'>Planned</span>"]
    hubsrv --> priv
    hubsrv --> relayHub
    hubsrv -.-> fwd
  end

  subgraph agentpc["Agent computer · built"]
    sealed["<b>Sealed runtime host</b><br/><span class='d'>None running yet · OpenCode only<br/>Agent credentials only · hub writes refused</span>"]
    bridge["<b>Tool calls sent back to the hub</b><br/><span class='d'>Planned</span>"]
    sealed -.-> bridge
  end

  subgraph space["Space server · shipped"]
    spacesrv["<b>Spaces for other people</b><br/><span class='d'>Own entry and image · Postgres · agents are members</span>"]
  end

  cloud["<b>DorkOS Cloud · optional</b><br/><span class='d'>Hub assignment · starts and stops computers · directory</span>"]

  relayMac -->|"signed frames<br/>chats only"| relayHub
  fwd -.->|"turns, agent sync"| sealed
  bridge -.->|"tool calls, as the agent"| relayHub
  mac <-->|"pairing"| spacesrv
  hubsrv <-.->|"pairing · planned"| spacesrv
  hubsrv -->|"reads its assignment"| cloud
  cloud -.->|"start, stop · contract only"| sealed
  mac -->|"optional link"| cloud

  subgraph key["Key"]
    direction LR
    k1["Built"]
    k2["Planned"]
    k3["Optional Cloud"]
    k1 ~~~ k2 ~~~ k3
  end

  classDef planned fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#8a9bab,color:#3b4a58,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef cloud fill:#fff5e4,stroke:#a87720,color:#49320c
  class fwd,bridge,k2 planned
  class cloud,k3 cloud
